{"id": "25621", "title": "原始之魔", "author": "pkhqi123", "category": "玄幻魔法", "count": 128, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/25/25621.htm", "intro": "地球上一个叫做【中国】的国家中的书籍记载，他们将气功分为『外气功』以及『内气功』两种，而『外气功』就算练到最高成就，在他们眼中只是使用蛮力的下等功法，很不幸的【奥兰比亚世界】中的『斗气』，包括『黄金斗气』、『圣斗气』及『魔斗气』在内全都是外气功的一种，全是凭著血气之力推动的武术，如果不能兼修内气功，在中老年之後便会功力大退，因此在【奥兰比亚世界】中的武术高手大多是在五十岁以下，年纪较轻的武者。", "base": "files/article/html/25/25621", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "【一】创世神界", "file": "1794910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【二】合体同化", "file": "1794911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【三】升级考试", "file": "1794912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【四】代理魔神", "file": "1794913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【五】暗夜杀机", "file": "1794914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【六】神魔之战", "file": "1794915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【七】天使异变", "file": "1794916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【八】天使之恋", "file": "1794917.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【九】王宫决斗", "file": "1794918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【十】冥界之王", "file": "1794919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二集", "volume": true}, {"title": "【十一】重返人间", "file": "1794920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【十二】首次任务", "file": "1794921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【十三】出云公主", "file": "1794922.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【十四】装神扮鬼", "file": "1794923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【十五】提升力量", "file": "1794924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【十六】恐惧迷宫", "file": "1794925.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【十七】天使龙兽", "file": "1794926.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【十八】堕落天使", "file": "1794928.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【十九】杀鸡警猴", "file": "1794929.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【二十】十年之约", "file": "1794930.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三集", "volume": true}, {"title": "【廿一】迷幻之岛", "file": "1794931.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【廿二】风云始动", "file": "1794932.html", "available": 